{{also|под}}
==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|ru|подо-}} {{i|before certain consonant clusters}}

===Etymology===
Inherited from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*podъ-}}; see {{m|sla-pro|*podъ}} for further information.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|под-|ann=y}} {{i|before vowels and voiced consonants}}
* {{ru-IPA|пот-|ann=под-}} {{i|before voiceless consonants}}
* {{ru-IPA|по́д-|ann=y}} {{i|when stressed, before vowels and voiced consonants}}
* {{ru-IPA|по́т-|ann=по́д-}} {{i|when stressed, before voiceless consonants}}

===Prefix===
{{head|ru|prefix|cat2=verbal prefixes}}

# {{lb|ru|used with verbs}} [[upwards]] {{gloss|describing an action of moving from the bottom up}}
#: {{prefex|ru|бро́сить|g1=pf|t1=to throw|подбро́сить|g2=pf|t2=to throw upwards}}
# {{lb|ru|used with verbs}} [[closer]] {{gloss|describing an action of approaching to an entity}}
#: {{prefex|ru|идти́|g1=impf|t1=to go (by walking)|подойти́|g2=pf|t2=to walk up to, to approach (by walking)}}
# {{lb|ru|used with verbs}} [[adding]] {{gloss|describing an action of adding more entity}}
#: {{prefex|ru|-ба́вить|подба́вить|g2=pf|t2=to add, replenish}}
# {{lb|ru|used with verbs}} {{gloss|describing a meaning that shows a finished action or an obtainment of a result}}
#: {{prefex|ru|стричь|g1=impf|t1=to cut|подстри́чь|g2=pf|t2=to cut up}}
#: {{prefex|ru|писа́ть|g1=impf|t1=to write|подписа́ть|g2=pf|t2=to sign, to subscribe {{i|in the sense of writing one's name with a result}}}}
# {{lb|ru|used with verbs}} {{gloss|describing an action of copying or following someone's action}}
#: {{prefex|ru|да|t1=yes|-кать|pos2=suffix forming verbs from expressions|-ивать|pos3=imperfectivizing suffix|подда́кивать|g4=impf|t4=to say yes, to assent {{i|in the sense echoing "yes"}}}}
# {{lb|ru|used with verbs}} {{gloss|describing an existence of the certain action that is weak, invisible, hidden or incomplete}}
#: {{prefex|ru|уста́ть|g1=pf|t1=to get tired|подуста́ть|g2=pf|t2=to get tired slightly or lightly}}
#: {{prefex|ru|слать|g1=pf|t1=to send, dispatch|подосла́ть|g2=pf|t2=to send something (secretly)}}

===Prefix===
{{head|ru|prefix}}

# {{n-g|takes nouns, produces nouns or adjectives}}: [[under-]], [[sub-]] {{gloss|referring to literal position under something, being under the influence of something, occupying a title or position below a superior, etc.}}
#: {{prefex|ru|земля́|t1=ground|-ный|подзе́мный|t3=underground}}
#: {{prefex|ru|гру́ппа|t1=group|подгру́ппа|t2=subgroup}}
#: {{prefex|ru|власть|t1=authority, control|-ный|подвла́стный|t3=subjected, dependant}}
#: {{prefex|ru|Карпа́ты|t1=[[Carpathians]] {{i|mountains}}|-ье|Подкарпа́тье|t3=[[Subcarpathia]] {{gloss|region surrounding the Carpathian mountains}}}}
#:* {{prefex|ru|ма́стер|t1=master|-ье|подмасте́рье|t3=apprentice}}
# {{n-g|takes adjectives, produces adverbs}}: completely
#:* {{prefex|ru|чи́стый|t1=clean||alt2=-у́ю|pos2=feminine accusative ending|подчисту́ю|t3=without remainder}}

====Usage notes====
* In the meaning of ''closer'', only use под- when the subject is in the sight range of the object of interest, and then moves even closer towards it.
:* {{ux|ru|[[я|Я]] [[подойти|подошла́]] [[к]] [[памятник|па́мятнику]].|I walked up to the statue.|footer=<small>(I already was in the same room or space with it, and then walked closer to it.)</small>}}
:* {{ux|ru|[[я|Я]] [[прийти|пришла́]] [[к]] [[памятник|па́мятнику]].|I arrived at the statue.|footer=<small>(I came to the statue from somewhere further.)</small>}}

